    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enehu, naamba hivi, mana nagomba na atu ambao anamanya Shariya. Kpwa hivyo mnamanya kukala mutu ni lazima alunge Shariya achikala achere mzima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sambi nindahumira mfwano huno. Shariya ya ndowa inaamba kala mchetu kaweza kuricha mlumewe wakati achere mzima. Ela mlume achifwa, yuya mchetu a huru; yani, katawalwa tsona ni shariya ya ndowa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Achihalwa ni mlume wanjina na kuno mlumewe ni mzima, phahi andaihwa mzindzi. Ela mlumewe achifwa, iyo shariya taimfunga tsona, na anaweza kulólwa ni mlume wanjina.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.7.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vivyo hivyo enehu, dza viratu mutu achifwa katawalwa tsona ni shariya, mwimwi namwi tamtawalwa tsona ni Shariya za Musa. Mana ni avi mwafwa phamwenga na Jesu msalabani, na vivi mu akpwe. Naye wafufulwa ili swiswi humhumikire Mlungu na kumuhamira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana asili yehu ya chibinadamu phokala ikatawala maazo gehu, Shariya zahenda tamaa mbii za miri yehu zikale na nguvu zaidi. Dzambo hiri rahenda hulonde kuhenda makosa chila wakati ambago mwishowe ni chifo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hwakala mateka a Shariya, na hwajaribu kumuhumikira Mlungu kpwa kulunga mambo ga kare goandikpwa mo Shariyani. Ela sambi hu huru, mana tahumhumikira Mlungu kpwa kulunga Shariya ela kpwa kulunga njira nyiphya ya kulongozwa ni Rohowe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.7.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
